src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.2ed8a5927d3ddd63:
Alfa Romeo Giulia 2021. godine je došla kod nas u Beogradu na planirano servisiranje. Nismo se ograničili samo na zamenu ulja: pregledali smo sve potrošne delove i istovremeno obavili servis automatske transmisije.

Šta smo uradili:

- zamenili sveće;
- zamenili motorno ulje;
- zamenili filter ulja;
- zamenili vazdušni filter;
- zamenili kabinski filter;
- potpuno zamenili karter automatske transmisije;
- zamenili ulje u automatskoj transmisiji ZF 8HP.

Posebnu pažnju smo posvetili transmisiji. Kod automatskih prenosa **ZF 8HP**, stanje ulja i kartera je potrebno držati pod kontrolom i ne odlagati servis: na vreme servisirana transmisija je znatno jeftinija od one koja je kasnije morala da se popravlja.

src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.e56766c48bb91541:
The 2021 Alfa Romeo Giulia came to us in Belgrade for scheduled maintenance. We didn't stop at just an oil change; we went through all the consumables and also serviced the automatic transmission.

What we did:

- replaced the spark plugs;
- replaced the engine oil;
- replaced the oil filter;
- replaced the air filter;
- replaced the cabin filter;
- completely replaced the automatic transmission oil pan;
- changed the oil in the ZF 8HP transmission.

We paid special attention to the transmission. For **ZF 8HP** automatics, it's essential to monitor the condition of the oil and pan and not delay maintenance: a well-maintained transmission costs considerably less than a repaired one.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.1476daa1cb3181c0:
**Audi Q7 2008. Veliki spisak radova u našem autoservisu u Beogradu, Srbija.**

Kod nas je stigla Audi Q7 2008. godine sa značajnim spisakom kvarova. Automobil je zahtevao ozbiljnu pažnju, kako na podvozju, tako i na motoru.

Šta je urađeno:

- zamena kontrolnih nosača;
- zamena kočionih diskova i pločica;
- radovi na podešavanju motora;
- ponovno zaptivanje usisnog sistema;
- zamena EGR creva;
- malo tehničko održavanje sa promenom ulja i filtera.

Poseban problem je bio vezan za stalno curenje motornog ulja. Nakon prethodnog servisa, ispustna šraf je bio pogrešno postavljen, i ulje je konstantno curilo iz motora. Problem je rešen, sve je dovedeno u red.

Audi Q7 prve generacije zahteva stručno održavanje, posebno kod starijih vozila sa velikim pređenim kilometrima: važno je utvrditi uzrok kvara i otkloniti ga, a ne samo zameniti deo.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.4e58dd9d347eb723:
**2008 Audi Q7. Extensive list of services at our car service in Belgrade, Serbia.**

We welcomed a 2008 Audi Q7 with a significant list of issues. The vehicle required serious attention regarding both the suspension and the engine.

What was done:

- replaced suspension arms;
- replaced brake discs and pads;
- performed engine alignment work;
- resealed the intake system;
- replaced the EGR tube;
- conducted a minor service including oil and filter replacement.

A separate issue was related to a persistent oil leak. The drain plug had been incorrectly installed during the previous service, causing oil to drip continuously from the engine. We resolved the problem and put everything back in order.

The first-generation Audi Q7 requires careful maintenance, especially in older cars with high mileage: it's important to understand the root cause of the issue and address that, rather than simply replacing with a new part.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.6c8bbf4e3f96c88a:
The Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 arrived at our car service in Belgrade for a minor service.

We performed:

- an oil change;
- replaced the oil filter;
- replaced the engine air filter;
- replaced the cabin air filter;
- replaced all brake pads;
- serviced and inspected the braking system.

A note on the brakes: Brake pads are one of the key safety components, and it's important to check them regularly. When we change the pads, we also inspect the **discs, calipers, and guides**: if any of these are rusted or worn out, the car will brake unevenly.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.cf30f1bc554af19c:
Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 je došao u naš servis u Beogradu na malo održavanje.

Urađeno je:

- zamena motorog ulja;
- zamena uljnog filtera;
- zamena vazdušnog filtera motora;
- zamena kabinskog filtera;
- zamena svih kočionih pločica;
- servis i provera kočionog sistema.

Detaljnije o kočnicama. Pločice su jedan od ključnih elemenata bezbednosti, i potrebno je redovno paziti na njih. Kada menjamo pločice, uvek proveravamo i **diskove, čeljusti i vodilice**: ako je nešto od toga zahrđalo ili istrošeno, kočenje će biti neujednačeno.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.596ba06341d6d94e:
The MINI Cooper SD with a diesel **2.0 B47 engine producing 170 hp** came to our service center in Belgrade for comprehensive maintenance.

We performed the following services:

- engine oil replacement;
- all filters replacement;
- fuel filter replacement;
- oil change in the 8-speed Aisin automatic transmission;
- computer diagnostics of the engine and electronic systems;
- intake system diagnostics.

The fuel filter on a diesel engine should be replaced no less than once every **20,000 km**: this protects the fuel system and ensures the engine operates smoothly.

During the intake diagnostics, we discovered significant contamination: the swirl flaps were coated with soot and carbon buildup, creating a dense layer. We recommended a cleaning, which the owner accepted, and the intake was thoroughly cleaned.

The B47 diesel engine in BMW and MINI, along with the Aisin automatic transmission and intake system, thrive on regular maintenance: timely oil and filter changes, and keeping an eye on the intake condition. This way, expensive repairs can be postponed for a long time.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.e8bcb915c90e3b28:
MINI Cooper SD sa dizel motorom **2.0 B47 od 170 k** stigao je u naš servis u Beogradu na kompletnu uslugu.

Izvršili smo:

- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih filtera;
- zamenu gorivnog filtera;
- zamenu ulja u 8-stepenom automatskom menjaču Aisin;
- kompjutersku dijagnostiku motora i elektronskih sistema;
- dijagnostiku usisnog sistema.

Gorivni filter kod dizela treba menjati najmanje jednom na **20 000 km**: tako se štiti gorivni sistem, a motor radi stabilno.

Tokom dijagnostike usisa otkrili smo značajno zagađenje: vortex lopatice su bile prekrivene čađom i naslagama, gustim „kaputom“. Ponudili smo vlasniku čišćenje, on je pristao, i usis je potpuno očišćen.

Dizel B47 na BMW i MINI, automatski menjač Aisin i usisni sistem vole redovnost: na vreme menjati ulje i filtere, obratiti pažnju na stanje usisa. Tada se skupi popravak odlaže na duže vreme.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.7f4a11abfe3f6d51:
U naš servis u Beogradu stiglo je vozilo sa pritužbom na **vibraciju prilikom kočenja**: vozač pritisne papučicu, a automobil počne da se trese.

Počeli smo sa balansiranjem točkova — to je najčešći uzrok takve vibracije i najlakše ga je isključiti. Balansiranje je bilo u redu, nastavili smo dalje sa kočionim sistemom.

Na oko, diskovi i pločice su izgledali u redu, bez očiglednih tragova jakog trošenja. Prilikom pažljivog pregleda otkriveno je da je **levi kočioni disk deformisan**. On je uzrokovao vibraciju.

Pokažemo klijentu, dogovorimo popravku. Šta smo uradili:

- dijagnostika kočionog sistema;
- provera i balansiranje točkova;
- otkrivanje deformacije levog kočionog diska;
- zamena kočionih diskova;
- zamena kočionih pločica;
- ponovna provera balansiranja točkova;
- kontrolna vožnja nakon popravke.

Vibracija prilikom kočenja je nakon ovog postupka potpuno nestala, auto je provereno i predato vlasniku.

Disk može izgledati normalno, a u stvari biti kriv — golim okom se takva deformacija ne može primetiti. Zato, ako se pojavi ljuljanje volana, vibracija na papučici ili karoseriji prilikom kočenja, dijagnostiku je najbolje ne odlagati.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.c8b8f932a13e3ab3:
A vehicle arrived at our service center in Belgrade with a complaint of **vibration when braking**: the driver presses the pedal, and the car starts to shake.

We started with the wheel balancing — this is the most common cause of such vibration and it’s the easiest to rule out. The balancing was fine, so we moved on to the brake system.

At first glance, the discs and pads appeared to be in good condition, with no obvious signs of severe wear. Upon closer inspection, it turned out that the **left brake disc was deformed**. This was the source of the vibration.

We showed the customer and got the repair approved. Here’s what we did:

- diagnostics of the brake system;
- inspection and balancing of the wheels;
- identification of the deformation in the left brake disc;
- replacement of the brake discs;
- replacement of the brake pads;
- rechecking the wheel balancing;
- test drive after the repair.

The vibration when braking completely disappeared after this, and the car was checked and returned to the owner.

A disc can look normal while being warped — this kind of deformation is not detectable by the eye. Therefore, if you notice steering wheel wobble, pedal vibration, or body shaking during braking, it's best not to delay diagnostics.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.4ff8d2211b4eaa28:
The 2024 Peugeot 308 with a **1.5 BlueHDi** diesel engine came to our Russian car service in Belgrade for a major service. We performed a complete set of tasks:

- timing belt replacement;
- water pump replacement;
- coolant replacement;
- engine oil replacement;
- filter replacements;
- inspection and servicing of all related components.

There is a specific detail to note about the 1.5 BlueHDi engine: the camshaft drive chain. Early versions of the engine had a chain that was **7 mm** wide. Over time, this chain can stretch, and in the worst-case scenario, it may break, leading to severe engine damage.

When servicing such engines, it is recommended to install a reinforced **8 mm** chain, along with the camshaft bed and the camshafts themselves. For the 2023-2024 Peugeot 308 models, the 8 mm chain is already factory-installed.

This means that during a major service, it's important to check not only the timing belt but also the camshaft chain, considering the known characteristics of this particular engine.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.9b5995496644cca8:
Peugeot 308 iz 2024. godine sa dizel motorom **1.5 BlueHDi** došao je kod nas u ruski auto servis u Beogradu na veliki servis. Obavili smo kompletan spektar radova:

- zamena zupčastog remena;
- zamena vodene pumpe;
- zamena antifriza;
- zamena motornog ulja;
- zamena filtera;
- provera i održavanje svih pratećih komponenti.

Kod motora 1.5 BlueHDi postoji jedan važan detalj koji vredi posebno pomenuti: lanac koji pokreće bregaste osovine. U ranijim verzijama motora bio je lanac širine **7 mm**. Vremenom se istegne, a u najgorem slučaju može da se slomi i povuče za sobom motor.

Prilikom održavanja ovakvih motora preporučuje se postavljanje pojačanog lanca **8 mm**, zajedno sa postoljem bregastih osovina i samim bregastim osovinama. Na Peugeot 308 modelima iz 2023–2024. godine lanac od **8 mm** već dolazi sa fabrike.

To znači da prilikom velikog servisa treba obratiti pažnju ne samo na zupčasti remen, već i na lanac bregastih osovina, kao i na poznate karakteristike konkretnog motora.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.1f9ade85828c335e:
Seat Leon sa pređenih **190 000 km** došao je u naš nezavisni auto servis u Beogradu na veliko planirano održavanje, poznato kao veliki servis.

Na ovakvom broju pređenih kilometara najbolje je da se glavni sklopovi odmah servisiraju, pa smo uradili:

- zamenu kompleta remena GRM;
- zamenu vodene pumpe;
- zamenu antifriza;
- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih potrebnih filtera;
- zamenu zadnjih amortizera;
- zamenu ulja u DSG DQ250 menjaču.

Za Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda i Audi, veliki servis je osnovna tačka održavanja. Remen GRM, pumpa, tehničke tečnosti i potrošni materijali, koji se menjaju na vreme, sprečavaju mnogo skuplje probleme kasnije.

Posebno o **DQ250**. Ovo je šestostepeni robot sa mokrim spojnicama, a transmisijsko ulje u njemu treba menjati prema propisima — na tom menjaču se i održava.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.4b2a5ba7416d8106:
A **190,000 km** Seat Leon came into our Russian car service in Belgrade for a major scheduled maintenance, also known as a major service.

At this mileage, it is best to service the main components all at once, so we performed the following:

- replaced the timing belt kit;
- replaced the water pump;
- replaced the coolant;
- changed the engine oil;
- replaced all necessary filters;
- replaced the rear shock absorbers;
- changed the oil in the DSG DQ250 gearbox.

For Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda, and Audi, a major service is key for maintenance. Timely changes of the timing belt, pump, fluids, and consumables can prevent much more expensive problems down the road.

A note on the **DQ250**: This is a six-speed dual-clutch transmission with wet clutches, and the transmission oil must be changed according to the schedule — this is crucial to its performance.
